[node name="TollBoard" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-250, 150)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("14_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Toll Board"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Tolls of the Dawn Gate[/b]

Painted on oak, the old rates in white: a penny a foot, two for a horse, a silver mark for every laden cart. Below them, a newer board in fresher paint:

\"By order of the Merchants' Guild and with the Lord Protector's leave: carts bearing the Guild's seal pass free and uncounted.\"

Someone has scratched a single word into the wood beneath it: [i]Whose?[/i]"
reexamine_text = "Free and uncounted, for anyone with the Guild's seal."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/TollBoard"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_90x54")

