[node name="TollTally" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-150, 40)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("14_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Toll Slate"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The toll-keeper's slate[/b]

Chalk tallies for the week: farm carts, pilgrims, a drover's herd. One column has no figures at all, only a little drawn seal repeated again and again, each one beside a time after curfew.

[i]Guild. Ferrisford road. Not opened.[/i] Seven of them in six nights."
reexamine_text = "Seven sealed carts in six nights, none of them opened."

