[node name="WarrantBoard" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(262, 150)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("14_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Warrant Board"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The Rangers' board[/b]

A crown warrant, sun-faded at the edges:
\"[i]VARN, late sergeant of Fort Ashguard, deserter, who did carry off a wagon of the King's arms. Twenty crowns to whoever delivers him to the Commander. Signed, L. Ferrow.[/i]\" The sum has been raised twice in different ink.

Nailed over its corner, newer: \"[i]The King's Rangers will muster for the Western Valley. The tithe is three years short. By order of the Lord Protector.[/i]\""
reexamine_text = "Varn's warrant, and the muster order for the Western Valley."

